No program launching on this target

`open_uri` starts the desktop's URL handler with `posix_spawnp`, and this
platform launches nothing: no `posix_spawn`, no `environ` to hand it, and no
handler to start. On `__PROSPERO__` the call reports failure, which is what
the engine's caller already handles, and `<spawn.h>` is not included.

diff --git a/src/porting.cpp b/src/porting.cpp
index 4c24e8c..ca729e0 100644
